      "content": "Hey, I accidentally banged my head pretty hard on the kitchen cabinet just now. I'm on Eliquis for my heart stuff, but there's no blood or anything, just a little bump and a dull headache. Do I really need to go to the ER or can I just keep an eye on it at home for a bit?",
